cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite Jie Fu and Shihao Wang equally when using these computational
  materials. Cite the DOI of the specific archived release when available.
type: software
title: Computational materials for automorphism groups of smooth cubic threefolds and fourfolds
authors:
  - family-names: Fu
    given-names: Jie
    affiliation: Qiuzhen College, Tsinghua University
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0004-8622-612X
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Shihao
    affiliation: Qiuzhen College, Tsinghua University
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0007-1476-3104
abstract: >-
  Source programs, saved computations, and result catalogues for studies of
  automorphism groups of smooth cubic threefolds and cubic fourfolds. The
  materials include abstract group bounds, lattice computations,
  representation classification, and fourfold and threefold family records.
keywords:
  - cubic threefolds
  - cubic fourfolds
  - automorphism groups
  - GAP
  - OSCAR
repository-code: https://github.com/vegetablefj/autcub4fold
